window.products.push({"id":266088,"name":"Mid-Century Modern #4 Pillow Case Decorative Square Throw Pillow Covers Cushion Case Pillowcase for Sofa Couch Bed Chair Car 18x18 Inch/45x45 cm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fTMacXkvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High-Quality Fabric: Our decorative pillow cover is made of high-quality polyester and it is a very healthy, breathable lightweight fabric, which is gentle to the touch. Suited for all seasons of use, breathable for hot summer while warm for cold winter. Digital printing features bright colors and vivid patterns, not easy to fade. Repeated Use and Machine Washable, Machine Washable in cold water by gentle cycle, tumble dry low, no bleach, low iron if needed. Size: 18x18inch/45x45cm, due to manual measurement and cutting, please allow an error of 1-2cm. Please ensure your pillow is suitable for this size when you buy them. Double-sided printing. You can buy more, if one is dirty, you can replace the other. Hidden Zipper: Our throw pillow covers feature an easy slider zipper, there is a hidden metal zipper on the side, making them more beautiful and elegant. The invisible zipper of the pillow covers is of good quality and does not slip off easily or even remove frequently. the stitching of the pillow cover is tight and of good quality, with a large opening with an invisible zipper, easy to insert and take out. (COVER ONLY, INSERTS ARE NOT INCLUDED!!!) Decorative: Art pillow covers gradually become a common home use and decoration accessories in home life, they can be put in your arms to play a warm and protective role, but also increase interest in home life, different pillows can bring a different style and fashion. Multi-Use Occasions: Perfect pillow covers to decorate your room in a simple and fashionable way. Suitable for the couch, sofa, bed, car, seat, window seat, loveseat, living room, bedroom, floor, bench, office, cafe, etc.No matter decorate your home or send it to your friends, family, and parents as a holiday gift, it will be a perfect choice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fTMacXkvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TWSZGD","source_asin":"B0B4KL8TT1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-266088","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4KL8TT1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4KL8TT1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":266089,"name":"INNOMAX Vinyl Thermal Guardian Quantum Solid State Waterbed Heater, Full Watt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":62.3,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71C+wwXI7PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The InnoMax Thermal Guardian Quantum Full Watt Solid State Waterbed Heater temperature control enables you to precisely regulate your environment to maximize relaxation and maintain even skin temperature. InnoMax Thermal Guardian Quantum Full Watt Solid State Waterbed Heaters, for use with minimum 9” depth waterbeds in rigid side box or wood waterbed frames, are Certified to the standards of the Underwriter's Laboratories (UL) for Waterbed Heaters #1445. State-of-the-art Ultra sensitive electronic control that holds the temperature to 1/8 degree of set point ensuring consistent and accurate temperature sensing so your body can experience the deepest most restful sleep rather than working to keep itself warm by shivering or cool by sweating. InnoMax has been committed to producing the safest and most reliable products since 1975. As such, InnoMax Thermal Guardian heaters are visibly thicker as they are built to higher standards with waterproof vinyl enclosures, heat shields, L-Cut safety fuses and many other safety features not found in competitive heaters. InnoMax’s Waterbed Heater Pad is larger than competitive heaters because dispersing power over a greater area will ensure lower operating temperatures and eliminate hot spots. It is simple to understand why a larger heater pad is superior. Dividing heater wattage by the heater pad square inches nets watt density. The lower watt density of a larger pad keeps temperature density lower to avoid hot spots and helps extend the life of your waterbed mattress, safety liner and of course your waterbed heater. InnoMax consumer friendly Thermal Guardian Waterbed Heaters provide accuracy to 1/8 degree offering precise sleep environment temperature control and promoting energy efficiency. InnoMax Thermal Guardian Waterbed Heaters offer deeply satisfying winter warmth and refreshing coolness in summer for a sleep environment that offers comfort beyond compare and can offset heating or cooling bills for the whole house.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71C+wwXI7PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INNOMAX","source_asin":"B00AXT5H4M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-266089","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AXT5H4M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AXT5H4M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
