window.products.push({"id":266178,"name":"Kids Lunch Box with Supper Padded Inner Keep Food Cold Warm for Longer Time,Amersun Leak-proof Solid Insulated School Lunch Bag with Multi-Pocket for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LkwNjRNPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Kids Insulated Lunch Box- Amersun kids lunch bag is made of 3 layers of premium material. The exterior is made of water-resistant and stain-resistant Oxford cloth, which is reusable, durable and easy to clean. The middle layer uses 8MM insulating sponge, which can be kept constant temperature for 8-10 hours. The inner is made of food-grade aluminum foil, which is safe and easy to clean. Equipped with high quality zipper, easy to open (not suitable for adults) EXTRA STORAGE -The lunch box for kids has four pockets. The inner mesh pocket is suitable for storing knives, forks and spoons. Side pocket store your drinks, water bottles and even an umbrella. The rear pocket holds condiments and napkins, and the front zip pocket holds snacks, candy, napkins, keys, change, cards and other small items. Suitable for children of any age. DESIGNED FOR KIDS - The top of the girls' lunch bag can be opened with a double zipper, which means your lunch container can be placed in and out of the bag horizontally. Open design for easy access. It comes with a comfortable and detachable handle that can be attached to a backpack for easy portability. But please note that this lunch bag is not leak proof. SUITABLE SIZE & LARGE CAPACITY- The overall size of the school lunch box is 10.6\"Lx4.3\"Wx8.5\"H/ 27*11*21.5cm. The maximum capacity of the lunch box is 4L. A stylish lunch bag for school, travel and Everyday. This is the best gift for girls, boys, daughters, sons, grandchildren or granddaughters 2 YEARS WARRANTY- Amersun offers excellent quality products along with good customer service. Within 2 years, if you are not satisfied with the lunch tote bag, or there is a quality problem with the product, you can contact us through Amazon and we will reply and solve your problem within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LkwNjRNPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amersun","source_asin":"B09Q38FHMD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-266178","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q38FHMD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q38FHMD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
