window.products.push({"id":266207,"name":"Furniture of America Gwyneth Victorian Style Padded Fabric Arm Chair, Antique Oak Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":300.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81r-HtKrCTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Elegant and sophisticated, this Victorian-inspired arm chair is the ideal addition to any traditional home. Gold and red patterned fabric complement one another to make the padded fabric seat cushion and back offer a visual appeal. Beautiful curved arms and turned legs, along with a seat back frame design, are finished in an antique oak coat to emphasize the worldly appearance. Padded fabric offers comforting relaxation with fire retardant cushions. Enjoy a cup of tea or a captivating book while lounging on this exquisite arm chair. Spot clean with a damp, non-abrasive cloth. No harsh chemicals should be used. Manufactured in China, some assembly required. Dimensions: 24\"W x 26\"D x 40\"H; Seat height: 19\"; Seat depth: 19.5\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81r-HtKrCTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Furniture of America","source_asin":"B00H1LO1CY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-266207","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00H1LO1CY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00H1LO1CY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":266208,"name":"Leone di Fiume All Natural Luxury Soy Candle with Handmade Glass Jar, Amber, Vanilla & Coffee Highly Scented Aromatherapy Candle for Stress Relief and","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MJY0qhUqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LUXURY CRAFTSWOMANSHIP: We are here to set the standard in luxury candles and take great pride in sharing our craftswomanship. Every single Leone Di Fiume soy jar candle is produced by skilled artisans and hand-poured using superior-quality 100% natural soy wax with intoxicating, perfume-grade signature fragrances from Europe's top fragrance houses. Each candle jar is hand-crafted and each glass pattern is created and painted by hand. EXPERIENCE A UNIQUE FRAGRANCE: The fragrance pyramid opens with top notes of almond and black coffee. At the base notes, amber, incense, and vanilla merge seamlessly, revealing the perfect balance of oriental woody accords. Each fragrance complies with the IFRA standards and represents a different story with different scent notes. Using our heavenly scented soy candles as aromatherapy will calm your nerves, create a soothing ambiance and help you with anxiety, meditation, and sleep. RENEWABLE & BIODEGRADABLE: Our all-natural aromatherapy candles are made of pure soy wax, cotton wick, and a unique blend of essential oils and perfume-grade fragrance oils. All the ingredients used are vegan and give a non-toxic, soot-free, and clean burn. Soy wax is a biodegradable and renewable source, unlike paraffin, which is a by-product of petroleum. Leone di Fiume soy candles contain zero paraffin. Highly scented single wick candle also offers a burn time of 40 hours. SPOIL YOURSELF AND YOUR LOVED ONES: Our one-of-a-kind scented jar candle gift sets will help you to dazzle everyone with exceptional craftswomanship and a divine bouquet of aromas. The inspiring unique design and the elegant gift box make Leone di Fiume candles the perfect gift for any holiday or special events, such as Christmas, birthday, holiday, anniversary, Valentine’s Day, Mother’s Day, housewarming and thank you gifts for women and men. CANDLE CARE: Soy wax has a memory so each time you light the candle allow the melted wax pool to reach the edge of the container to avoid tunneling. And always trim the wick to ¼ inch before each use. Our soy jar candles are designed to be a keepsake after the candle is gone, repurpose the beautiful glass jar using your imagination and add a touch of luxury to your decoration. If you are not satisfied with your purchase, we invite you to take advantage of our full money-back guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MJY0qhUqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Leone di Fiume","source_asin":"B094N4WH6S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-266208","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094N4WH6S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094N4WH6S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
