window.products.push({"id":266293,"name":"Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner, 100PCS Non-Stick Parchment Paper (6.3 inches), Water-Proof, Oil Proof, Heat Resistant, Food Grade Baking Parchment","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51D00D7QIQL._AC_SL1073_.jpg","description":"- EASY TO USE: Each air fryer liner is a piece of parchment paper pressed into a bowl shape. This specific form that it takes allows the air fryer liner to be directly placed into an air fryer. No need for cutting, creasing, tearing, or any kind of deformation. - KEEPS AIR FRYER OR OTHER APPLIANCES CLEAN: Using this air fryer liner allows for mess to be avoided. Each liner used in the cooking process allows for grease to stay inside the liner, which essentially allows clean-up to be a breeze! All it takes is to simply take the liner out of the fryer and dispose of it in the nearest waste bin. - HEALTH & SAFETY: Our air fryer liner is made out of non-toxic, non-stick, food-grade quality parchment baking paper. The liner is able to withstand heats of 428 degrees Fahrenheit (220 degrees Celsius) for a maximum time of 20 minutes. - WIDELY APPLICABLE FOR DIFFERENT APPLIANCES: Our air fryer liner is not only meant to be used in an air fryer, but may also be used in a microwave oven, a conventional oven, steamer, BBQ (not over open flame) etc… suitable for family get-togethers, holiday parties, or any special occasion! - CAUTION: DO NOT put the liner in any appliance during pre-heating. DO NOT place the air fryer liner near the heating tube in the air fryer (or any primary heat source in any other appliance). DO NOT reuse the air fryer liner, dispose of each liner after a single use. Non-recyclable disposable item.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51D00D7QIQL._AC_SL1073_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09S7BB5YG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-266293","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09S7BB5YG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09S7BB5YG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":266294,"name":"MintCreek Bed Shelf 2.0 | Easy Device Charging | College Dorm, Bedside Storage, Bunk Beds | Removable Sides | 10 Power Cord Slots | Bedside Organizer ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91LO2ow0RRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You have four devices to charge (Oh, these first world problems). Charging cords keep getting in the way. Plus, you just want a convenient place to put a book you are reading, your car keys, and maybe a light for late-night reads. Where on earth do you put them all? What if you had a central station to charge all your devices in the same place and didn't have to keep moving cords all over the place? What if you could keep those other objects close and not keep losing them? Enter: THE BEDSIDE SHELF 2.0 * DESIGNED FOR YOUR DEVICES - With this bedside organizer you get a whopping 10 charging slots to allow those pesky charging cords to stay out of your way. No need to keep swapping out cords or repositioning them. They will be there when you need them. (PHEW!) * LARGE BASE - The 15”x10.25” fits your laptop (no matter the size) or many of your small devices, books, and other items you keep losing. (But now, no longer!) * USES - You can use it as a charging station for your mobile phone, tablet, computer, smart watch, CPAP machine (snore master) or to store your remotes, keys, medication, drinks, reading glasses, headphones, watch, journal, pens, and so much more. * SIMPLE - No tools needed. * PROTECTS YOUR BED - Protect your bedframe from damage with the felt-covered clamps. * LARGE CLAMPS - Fits most beds. Can grab and hold onto a frame up to 2.25\". (For metal frames with really thin sides, use a small piece of wood or small folded up piece of cardboard to act as spacer.) * EXPANDABLE - Remove any of the 4 sides and create a larger area allowing you to store more of your stuff. * DURABLE - The shelf is stable and strong thanks to the solid bamboo construction. (Bamboo: the wood of champions.) Proof: Read Corbin J.'s feedback. Hillarious. * Perfect for dorm rooms, bunk beds, small bedrooms.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91LO2ow0RRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MintCreek","source_asin":"B07J2RL926","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-266294","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07J2RL926","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07J2RL926","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
