window.products.push({"id":266340,"name":"Automatic Soap Dispenser Touchless - High Capacity 15.2 oz, Hands-Free Motion Sensor Waterproof, Countertop or Wall Mounted, Liquid Soap/Hand Sanitize","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81U21k9fLkS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✨ 𝗚𝗲𝘁 𝗠𝗼𝗿𝗲 𝘄𝗶𝘁𝗵 𝗗𝗶𝘀𝗽𝗲𝗻𝗼𝘃𝗮 - Our motion sensor soap dispenser gives you more of everything you need in a countertop or wall mountable touchless hand soap dispenser. More capacity than the leading brand at 15.2 oz, more options for how much soap to dispense at 4 adjustable levels, and fast dispensing with half a second response time ✨ 𝗦𝗶𝗺𝗽𝗹𝗶𝗳𝘆 𝗬𝗼𝘂𝗿 𝗖𝗹𝗲𝗮𝗻 𝗥𝗼𝘂𝘁𝗶𝗻𝗲 - Dispenova's new automatic touchless soap dispenser is so easy to use. Install the batteries, pour in up to 15.2 ounces of your favorite soap or hand sanitizer, adjust the amount you'd like to dispense, place your hand under the infrared motion sensor, and scrub-a-dub-dub ✨ 𝗤𝘂𝗮𝗹𝗶𝘁𝘆 & 𝗗𝘂𝗿𝗮𝗯𝗶𝗹𝗶𝘁𝘆 - Built with a high-quality motor and backed by a 2-year warranty, your new battery-operated contactless soap dispenser will stand the test of time and is suitable for home and commercial use. The waterproof casing and non-slip rubber grips ensure you can use it anywhere you need it ✨ 𝗦𝗼 𝗠𝗮𝗻𝘆 𝗨𝘀𝗲𝘀 - You need a kitchen, office and bathroom soap dispenser that is compatible with all types of liquids; from lotion to mouthwash, to detergent, to shampoo, and more. The perfect addition to the hotel reception desk, mount it to the wall at the store or restaurant entrance, or take it on the go for your next event ✨ 𝗖𝗼𝗺𝗽𝗹𝗶𝗺𝗲𝗻𝘁𝘀 𝗬𝗼𝘂𝗿 𝗗𝗲𝗰𝗼𝗿 - The modern colors and look of our pearl white, green, and bronze touchless soap dispensers will complement any decor, whether kitchen sink or shower wall. Manual pump soap dispensers are okay, but automatic countertop soap dispensers are more fun and convenient and make great housewarming gifts","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81U21k9fLkS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dispenova","source_asin":"B08K2CBNJC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-266340","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K2CBNJC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K2CBNJC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
