window.products.push({"id":266441,"name":"Azerlee Handmade Crochet Tablecloth Cotton Lace Table Cloth Rectangular Table Cover for Kitchen Dinning Wedding Party Decoration, Beige, 55 X 86 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713FAWP5CyL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Way to Choose the Right Size ▪ 1.width of tablecloths = width of your table + width of overhang X 2▪ 2.length of tablecloths = length of your table + length of overhang X 2▪ The overhang between 10 to 13 inches would look better. Enhance Your Home ▪ Each design pays close attention to every single detail and to ensure the best quality of our rectangle lace tablecloth.▪ With the natural drape effect and diversified handmade crochet lace pattern, your dining table will look more decent and elegant, bring you both functional and decorative experience.▪ Decorate your table with this versatile lace table cloth, give your dining table a stylish appearance and protect it from scratches and stains, add tasteful and modern color to your mealtimes. Compliments Many Different Styles ▪ Adding a little pattern and texture atop your table with neutral colors lace table linen will add that finishing touch to your farmhouse dining display.▪ The elegant lace cotton tablecloth is perfect for a Spring or Summer bridal shower, rehearsal dinner, or wedding reception.▪ This sophisticated table setting is sure to wow your guests and inspires everyone to get in the Holiday spirit. Warm Tips ✔ Measure your table to make sure what you selected is the appropriate size✔ Actual color may vary from the color on your screen due to monitor color restrictions. About Us ▪ Our product covers the most you need to decorate your sweet homes it includes a tablecloth, curtain valance, cushion and throws blanket, etc▪ Over the past years, we have accumulated rich knowledge in the home textiles.We aim to bring comfort, fashion, quality, elegance to our customers.▪ Azerlee is a good choice for decorative homes so you can create and enjoy your dream home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713FAWP5CyL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Azerlee","source_asin":"B07DL4J8TD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-266441","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DL4J8TD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DL4J8TD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
