window.products.push({"id":266540,"name":"Jumeey Black Geometric Duvet Cover Twin Marble Bedding Set Black White Silver Grey Gold Duvet Cover Set Teens Abstract Modern Plaid Triangle Comforter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jrqPZYcTL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"Jumeey Home Collection, healthy and comfortable, we are strive to find the perfect combination of beautiful design, excellent quality and unbeatable value.  *Please note: comforter or duvet insert is not included.   Package includes:  1 × Duvet cover(No comforter) 2 × Pillow shams(No filling)  Size information: Twin size Duvet cover: 68 by 86 inches  Pillow case: 20 by 26 inches  Full/Queen size Duvet cover: 90 by 90 inches  Pillow case: 20 by 26 inches  Benefits: Marble Duvet Cover Set, as a protective layer, encases your soft quilt, down comforter and duvet to increase longevity of your expensive duvet inserts away from dusts and dirt - Removable comforter cover ensures easier hassle-free washing in machine, unlike heavy comforter requires dry cleaning - As a thin lightweight blanket in summer and a thick comforter's cover in winter to offer optimal comfort.   Wash Instruction: ·Wash separately, avoid soaking for more than 30 minutes ·Machine wash in cold water ·Do not bleach ·No tumble dry ·Do not dry-clean  Warm Tips ♥Please wash before using: Washing removes packaging dirt.The fabric will be wrinkled after washing, but it will feel more soft and comfortable. ♥Due to the differences in computer monitors, actual products may have a slight color difference with the picture; for the different manual measurement ways, there may be 1-2cm(0.3-0.8inch) error.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jrqPZYcTL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Houseri","source_asin":"B09VL4JY4T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-266540","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VL4JY4T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VL4JY4T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":266541,"name":"Eminent Craft - Bed Spread - Amarosi - Handmade - Cotton - 90' X 60'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81g5V77dINL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Kantha is a unique style of a running hand stitch. It is done by using a colored cotton thread as a running stitch sewn in patterns across two or more layers of natural cotton voile fabric sheets. The cotton thread used to stitch the soft cotton sheets together results in a slightly wrinkled wavy look on the soft layers of cotton sheets. This Kantha stitched fabric is used in making quilts, bed covers, table tops, pillow covers, etc. Kantha quilts are not filled with cotton batting, and thus are lighter than the cotton filled quilts. These colorful quilts with additional patchwork as motifs have a soft and light feel and can be used in many ways besides adding beauty to the interior décor of your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81g5V77dINL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eminent Craft","source_asin":"B01CX9IIEA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-266541","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CX9IIEA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CX9IIEA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":266542,"name":"jing Heavy Duty Adjustable Curtain Rod Brackets Curtain Rod Hanging Brackets Wall Mount Curtain Single Rod Bracket for 25mm1 Rod Silver Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61It9GxGSEL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Product description: Color: Silver Feature: curtain rod brackets are classic designed for curtain rods and draperies.Quick hang curtain brackets can provide ample support for most type curtain rods and drapery rod. The bracket can accommodate curtain rods from 3/4 inch to 1 inch in diameter, adjustable support, adjustable length to extend 4.53 inches from wall, 5/8 inch for inner side and 1 inch for outer side.they can hold up to 25 lbs of weight without damaging the wall. Curtain rod brackets wall mount can be used in new installations or as replacement brackets for existing rods.Curtain rod mounting brackets can be used for window curtain rod, door curtain rod. Curtain rod support also can be used for wooden window frame,vertical blinds, inside or outdoor, existing rods.Hang curtain rod brackets are perfect suit for bedroom, living room, dining room, office, or kitchen. These brackets comes with 6 matching screws and anchors,so you can install them easily. Specification: Material: Steel Colour: Silver Size: 90x20x45mm/ 3.55x0.8x1.8 inch . ?Hassle-Free ?: Here with our 90-day money back risk-free purchase , Refund or Replacement for any quality problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61It9GxGSEL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"jing","source_asin":"B098LDSTJK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-266542","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098LDSTJK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098LDSTJK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":266543,"name":"Huddleson Navy Blue Italian Linen Table Runner Made in USA 18\"x64\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":65.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RTh9M9elL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Italian Linen Made in USA 100% PURE ITALIAN LINEN, which is extremely durable and resilient, many times stronger than cotton. Linen fabric is woven from the stems of the flax plant, whose unique structure is why linen is both supple and resistant without pilling or becoming distorted. To create our linen fabric requires minimal processing and no chemicals. Year after year, wash after wash, the fibers do not stretch out of shape, break or pill, while at the same time becoming softer and more beautiful. MADE IN USA. Huddleson is the leading independent manufacturer of contemporary fine table and bed linens, based in Los Angeles. We source our European linen from the premier linen mills in Northern Italy and cut and sew the finished products in California, USA. Huddleson linens have been featured by many of the top design magazines and blogs including Traditional Home, House Beautiful, Robb Report, Food & Wine, Real Simple, Lonny, Remodelista and lots more. MACHINE WASHABLE. Linen fabric cleans very well in the washing machine. If your linen tablecloth or table linens pick up marks or stains, soak overnight in a stain remover like OxiClean and then machine wash. VIBRANT, LUXURIOUS, CLASSIC linen has a texture, feel and drape that has been admired for thousands of years, because it is elegant, lustrous and comforting. Linen represents simple, classic, sophisticated good taste. Also, because of linen?s highly absorbent nature, it holds dye very deeply for a saturated, rich color that fades minimally. This solid colored table runner in a rich indigo navy blue pure linen provides a timeless, elegant backdrop. A classic color that will never go out of style - and will give you years of use whether for everyday use or reserved for entertaining. Size: 18\"x64\" Runner","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RTh9M9elL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Huddleson","source_asin":"B07F9PSPNC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-266543","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07F9PSPNC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07F9PSPNC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
