window.products.push({"id":266663,"name":"mDesign Extra Wide Light Weight Waffle Weave Polyester Shower Curtain with Reinforced Buttonholes, for Bathroom Showers and Bathtubs - Woven Geometric","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QtDvGBsoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM QUALITY: Beautifully woven from high quality polyester yarns; The tight weave fabric construction drapes nicely; Made to withstand damp, moisture rich bathroom environments; Generously sized; Set of 2 CLASSIC STYLING: Features a waffle weave pattern designed after luxury hotel shower curtains; Soft hand feel; Sturdy top hem with reinforced buttonholes that hold up to daily use; Instantly upgrades any bath to create a relaxing spa-like environment; mDESIGN TIP: Check your space to ensure that you have the curtain of the appropriate width, this is much wider than a standard shower curtain which is typically no more than 72 inches SIMPLE INSTALLATION: Each curtain contains 18 reinforced buttonholes that fit most standard shower hooks (not included), and the generous size is sure to fit most bathtubs and showers; Extra wide for larger showers, bathtubs, claw-foot tubs, and open tubs that requires a wrap-around curtain; Machine washable to keep mold and mildew away QUALITY CONSTRUCTION: Made of 100% Polyester; Easy Care - machine wash cold with like colors; Tumble dry low; Use of a liner recommended; This shower curtain is not waterproof GENEROUSLY SIZED: Each Measures 108\" x 72\" long; (Please note - this curtain is 36\" wider than a standard shower curtain which is typically no more than 72\" wide)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QtDvGBsoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"mDesign","source_asin":"B079SH6SNM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-266663","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079SH6SNM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079SH6SNM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":266664,"name":"GFWARE Toothbrush Holder Toothpaste Dispenser Wall Mounted Cover Electric Tooth Brush Stand Set with 2 Toothpaste Squeezers for Shower Bathroom Kids B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6193TBCMcgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"►Food-Grade Material & Practical◄ This Toothbrush storage being made of PC+ABS and is qualitified food-grade material. This toothbrush holder is durable and sturdy. Containing 2 automatic toothpaste dispensers and 4 toothbrush holders, it can serves for both kids and adult in your whole family. Glossy and smooth texture won't broke and your fingers is prevented from the scrath. ►Anti-Dust & Economical◄The Magnetic switch design keep your toothbrush far from dust. Durable vacuum extrusion pump help everyone in your home squeeze out the certain amount of toothpaste they need.Your kids can easily press the pump and dispense the toothpaste by themselves. Everything becomes tidy in the counter. There will be no waste of tooth paste and your teeth brush will always be dry. ►Detachable& Cleanable◄ The tooth brush holder is easy to disassemble reassemble. The wall-mounted component make it simply to install and no need to punch holes. You can conveniently remove the wall toothbrush holder from the adhesive strip and clean it. The brush holder can bring a better using effect if you rinse it once in 5-7 days. ►Fit Most of Toothbrush and Toothpaste◄ This organizer fits most of the universal Toothbrush and Toothpaste in the market. The auto toothpaste dispenser is specifically designed for toothpaste tube less than 0.47inch(1.3cm).The slots of the toothpaste distributor is made of silicone, so it has a strong encapsulation.When using the toothbrush dispenser for the first time, patiently and lightly press for several times until toothpaste come out. ►Stable Adhesive◄ This toothbrush and Toothpaste storage consists of sturdy and traceless adhesive strips that have perfect caulking ability. The hanging toothbrush holder set is unlikely to fall down as long as you make sure the wall is clean and dry before installtion. It's better to install it on smooth wall such as metal, wood and ceramic wall,mirror ect..","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6193TBCMcgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GFWARE","source_asin":"B09PYXF3DT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-266664","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PYXF3DT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PYXF3DT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
