window.products.push({"id":266725,"name":"Cosvino Vacuum Wine Stopper Air Sealer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XGGLvTqCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The clock is ticking From the time you extract the cork from that bottle of merlot or chardonnay, air begins to affect its esters and flavor. Savor your unfinished wine for another 3-5 days with the Cosvino Wine Stopper Vacuum for bottles. An essential kitchen gadget for any wine connoisseur, this innovative stopper draws out any air from inside of the bottle, slowing the oxidation process that robs your reds and whites of their fresh colors and aromas. In as little as 15 seconds, it seals out air particulates and preserves that full-bodied flavor. Cosvino does all the work There are no buttons to push and no exertion other than placing the vacuum wine pump over the bottle opening and pressing downward to activate the motor. A digital counter keeps you apprised of the time remaining as the pump draws a vacuum of 19hg inside of the bottle. A 360-degree indicator light turns from blue to green to signal that the cycle is complete. Your Cosvino Wine Saver Pump is designed to fit all bottle tops so you can use it on champagne and prosecco bottles as well as for your favorite pinot grigio. Designed for long-lasting durability Powered by 2 AAA batteries in a rugged ABS plastic housing, this stylish wine preserver and champagne stopper makes a thoughtful housewarming or wedding gift for wine lovers. It takes up little space among your kitchen gadgets, and it wipes clean with just a damp cloth for carefree maintenance. Preserve the bouquet of your unfinished wine. Add the Cosvino Automatic Vacuum Wine Bottle Pump to your wine accessories today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XGGLvTqCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cosvino","source_asin":"B088VMFJ78","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-266725","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088VMFJ78","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088VMFJ78","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
