window.products.push({"id":266816,"name":"sanwo Moon Earth Stars 3D Glow in The Dark Sticker, Night Luminous Set Room Wall Decal Stickers with Self Adhesive for Home Decorations (11.8inch)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LU-mJfP5L._SL1080_.jpg","description":"During the day, it is just like a real and normal moon. But when the sun goes down, the sky getting darker and darker, the moon is filled with magic and mystery. Glow in the dark star moon with super bright. Product Features: ☑ The decals will stay securely attached, till you remove them. ☑ Safe for wall - will not mark or damage your walls. ☑ With this glow in the dark galaxy set ,it adds the look of a real night sky . No more plastic synthetic look. ☑ In day time it's white clean look, the dots merge with the wall . And in the dark the room become starry shiny bedroom. ☑ We created our glow in the dark stars and moon with an extraordinarily luminous powder called Europium-doped Strontium Aluminate. ☑ We used twice as much as you’ll find elsewhere. The result is that your glow in the dark stars and moon will remain luminous for up to 18 hours before use sunshine and lamp light to illuminate them. The longer the better.  What you get? 30 x 30 cm super bright glow in the dark moon 6 Count Removable Moons and 6 Count Removable Stars NOTE: 1. This product needs daylight , after absorb daylight it will glow in night. 2. It only fits for smooth place where without powder on it like mirror, glass and wall.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LU-mJfP5L._SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sanwo","source_asin":"B0089E82UO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-266816","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0089E82UO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0089E82UO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":266817,"name":"Koorlian Twin Mattress Topper, 3 Inch Gel Memory Foam Mattress Topper for College Dorm and RV, Soft Pressure Relief Twin Size Mattress Pad with Bamboo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CmJ56YFrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DUAL-LAYER FOAM DESIGN: Our mattress topper twin is made of 2 inch gel infused memory foam and 1 inch high density support foam that give your bed a luxurious balance of pressure relief and body support. 3 inch twin memory foam mattress topper is softer than the 2 inch but firmer than the 4 inch, medium firm. The ventilated memory foam blueprint of our twin bed mattress pad provides better airflow throughout the night to prevent you from sleeping hot. REMOVABLE & WASHABLE COVER: Removable & machine washable bamboo cover with zipper helps keep your bed topper clean and safe to create a healthier and more comfortable living environment for you. The inner polyester lining of twin foam mattress topper effectively prevents wear and tear of the memory foam core, thus extending your topper for a longer lifetime. UPGRADE & TRANSFORM, NOT REPLACE: This matress toppers for twin beds are desgined with protect cover and fitted eleastic strap that directly fit it on the mattress and prevent the topper from any shifting. The memory foam mattress topper twin is a more environmental-conscious and cost-sufficient way to comfortable sleep than a new mattress replacement. Transform your old bed into a new cradle without having to splurge on a whole new mattress! 100% BABY-SAFE MATERIALS: Our twin size mattress topper is CertiPUR-US certified and uses OEKO-Tex Standard 100 cover fabrics. Our twin matresses topper is vacuum-packed and in box. Note: It is normal for the new foam to have a slight odor; it's completely harmless and will dissipate over a short time with regular use. Before first use, please place the mattress topper flat in a well-ventilated area and allow 48-72 hours for expansion. CUSTOMER SERVICE: 100 nights sleep trial and a 1-year manufacture warranty are the basis of our customers’ satisfaction. Feel free to contact our 24/7 customer service directly if you encounter any questions. Each purchase of the Koorlian memory foam mattress topper includes a 1-year limited warranty for manufacturing defects (more details in users manual).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CmJ56YFrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Koorlian","source_asin":"B09XWZRBHB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-266817","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XWZRBHB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XWZRBHB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
