window.products.push({"id":266859,"name":"FANTASK White Ladder Shelf, Elegant 5-Tier Leaning Bookshelf, Wood Plant Flower Stand, Stable Storage Rack Shelves for Living Room, Office, Kitchen, H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":74.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613+jFvkcAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【5 Tier Shelves & Space Saving】 Featuring five layers of shelves with different widths, our leaning bookshelf provide ample space for books, family photos, potted plants, magazines, etc. The wood ladder shelf gets wider as descend, creating an attractive and unique storage method. Moreover, the inclined ladder shelves can not only keep your house organized, but also not take up too much space. 【Leaning Multifunctional Ladder】 This creative wood storage ladder shelf adopts not only elegant white color but also the unique minimalist sloping Leaning shape, adding a modern and rustic look to any room. It can be used as plant stand rack, bookcase, bathroom cabinet, storage organizer in your living room, bedroom, kitchen, balcony, office, etc. 【Sturdy and Stable Construction】 With leaning appearance, this ladder plant stand is still stable attaching to the wall. Each amazing ladder shelf is firmly fixed with screws to ensure sturdy and stable use and high load-bearing capacity. And combined with its odor free and moisture proof feature, our wood storage organizer is durable for long term use. 【User-friendly Details】The corners of this display rack have been carefully polished and designed into a round shape to prevent accidental skin scratching, ensuring safe use. What’s more, there are baffles on sides of the ladder storage shelves to prevent items from falling. 【Easy Assembly and Clean】Come with detailed instruction and all accessories, you will never have trouble in installing such a simple 5-tier shelves. This wood plant stand is not easy to get dirty, so you can easily maintain it. Even if there is a little dust on it, you can easily wipe it off with a damp cloth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613+jFvkcAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FANTASK","source_asin":"B08D8TJJRS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-266859","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D8TJJRS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D8TJJRS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
