window.products.push({"id":266993,"name":"58mm Calibrated Espresso Tamper Coffee Tamper with Spring Consistant 30lbs Pressure Portafilter Barista Coffee Machine Accessory","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZX2-SeTDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【PRESSURE REGULATING】Thanks to the integrated spring, the contact pressure approx 30lbs(14 kg), when fully compressed, the coffee grounds in the portafilter are compacted with consistent pressure every time. The perfect tamp for the best tasting espresso possible. 【ERGONOMIC HANDLE】The ergonomic handle made of pure real wood enables incredibly easy handling so that you can achieve perfect results with targeted pressure. 【MULTI-COMPATIBLE】This 58mm coffee tamper is compatible with espresso machines with portafilter from Breville, DeLonghi, Gaggia, Saeco, Ascaso, and many more. Please make sure what size your portafilter is, this is a 58mm tamper, only fits 58mm or large portafilters. 【EVEN BETTER COMPRESSION】The tamper consists of a high-quality wood handle and a tamper base made of 304 stainless steel. The tamper can be unscrewed, so it is adjustable and easy to clean, the base is also rust-free and dishwasher-safe. Thanks to an extra flat darning base, you can create a particularly soft and intense espresso. 【AFTER SALE】Since we trust 100% in the quality of our espresso tamper for your portafilter machine, we enable you to place an order without any risk: If you are dissatisfied, you can simply return the coffee tamper!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZX2-SeTDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ezebesta","source_asin":"B09FJSN5YS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-266993","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FJSN5YS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FJSN5YS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
